			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2809539">
									

<p>I still hold onto my initial critique regarding the first addendum. It begins with a claim that is not suggested of prior. You are better off focusing solely on the actions, and let readers deduce that the pillow is somehow sentient. Stating it from the get-go, in this case, ruins the entire addendum.</p>
<p>Also, I still fail to see why the insects need human hosts to reproduce. It feels like a contrived attempt to generate insect horror.</p>

